{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.043604651069534595,"t":"Introduction","x":0.82680412850782337,"w":0.12371133168538406},{"c":1,"t":"HOW SHOULD YOU INTERPRET YOUR SCORES?","w":0.68041239420572908,"y":0.093023255980810071,"x":0.053608235784048566,"h":0.015988371754420694},{"t":"At the end of each Listening and Reading Answer Key you will find a chart which will help","x":0.051546411024491284,"c":1,"w":0.85567006429036452,"h":0.017453809660879616,"y":0.13081395321125167},{"x":0.051455724776944295,"t":"you assess whether, on the basis of your Practice Test results, you are ready to take the","w":0.84759974161783858,"h":0.021622170018785858,"c":1,"y":0.14791133585616179},{"w":0.1117776107788086,"h":0.014424928272043447,"x":0.049320877532609525,"c":1,"t":"IELTS test.","y":0.1682893507676082},{"w":0.82474227905273434,"x":0.072164942840988525,"y":0.18750000016720858,"c":1,"t":"In interpreting your score, there are a number of points you should bear in mind. Your","h":0.015988371754420583},{"c":1,"x":0.053608232677009086,"t":"performance in the real IELTS test will be reported in two ways: there will be a Band Score","y":0.20493247228743006,"w":0.86597941080729179,"h":0.015997760098469094},{"x":0.051546381153256202,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1,"w":0.81855672200520824,"y":0.22372284202802706,"t":"from 1 to 9 for each of the components and an Overall Band Score from 1 to 9, which"},{"y":0.24273255786320735,"w":0.83298970540364592,"h":0.017441861012089888,"c":1,"t":"is the average of your scores in the four components. However, institutions considering","x":0.051546384325612468},{"x":0.051546386152893149,"w":0.82474227905273445,"t":"your application are advised to look at both the Overall Band Score and the Bands for","h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"y":0.26159718168986767},{"t":"each component in order to determine whether you have the language skills needed for a","w":0.85773193359375,"y":0.28038755142991778,"c":1,"h":0.01614797416324143,"x":0.05154640423405283},{"h":0.017441861012089777,"x":0.05154638380789521,"y":0.29796511600286624,"c":1,"t":"particular course of study. For example, if your course has a lot of reading and writing, but","w":0.86391754150390632},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.051546380658281238,"w":0.84948455810546875,"c":1,"t":"no lectures, listening skills might be less important and a score of 5 in Listening might be","y":0.31679389287918336},{"w":0.88865976969401039,"h":0.017441859892096456,"c":1,"y":0.33430232569348661,"t":"acceptable if the Overall Band Score was 7. However, for a course which has lots of lectures","x":0.051546402967427886},{"y":0.35319767414092507,"x":0.051546404186471571,"w":0.85773193359375011,"c":1,"h":0.017441861012089888,"t":"and spoken instructions, a score of 5 in Listening might be unacceptable even though the"},{"t":"Overall Band Score was 7.","y":0.37199060506883408,"c":1,"x":0.051546397413975265,"w":0.25979380289713544,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"c":1,"x":0.072164950963479746,"h":0.017441861012089666,"w":0.8453608194986979,"y":0.39098837181720469,"t":"Once you have marked your tests, you should have some idea of whether your listening"},{"x":0.049484555398272408,"w":0.85567006429036463,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"and reading skills are good enough for you to try the IELTS test. If you did well enough in","c":1,"y":0.40986494440911303},{"w":0.88659790039062503,"c":1,"t":"one component, but not in others, you will have to decide for yourself whether you are ready","y":0.42865531414904079,"x":0.049484554874529178,"h":0.017615971814445075},{"y":0.44767441864636193,"x":0.047422677683075044,"w":0.1546391805013021,"h":0.014534883616744709,"c":1,"t":"to take the test."},{"h":0.01614797416324143,"y":0.46506165604194072,"c":1,"x":0.074226816566011558,"t":"The Practice Tests have been checked to ensure that they are of approximately the same","w":0.85773193359374988},{"x":0.047422685550154713,"c":1,"t":"level of difficulty as the real IELTS test. However, we cannot guarantee that your score in the","w":0.89072163899739587,"y":0.48401162763141858,"h":0.017456369965621055},{"h":0.019908620550992295,"t":"Practice Tests will be reflected in the real IELTS test. The Practice Tests can only give you","c":1,"w":0.86410909016927073,"y":0.49929300300782575,"x":0.049384697380759332},{"x":0.049484544829228982,"w":0.87422678629557282,"h":0.017615971814445075,"y":0.52025836779140855,"t":"an idea of your possible future perfonnance and it is ultimately up to you to make decisions","c":1},{"x":0.048946756596701967,"y":0.53796938299813168,"w":0.2051538721720377,"t":"based on your score.","h":0.01959409058549022,"c":1},{"w":0.85791168212890634,"x":0.072079780856772593,"y":0.55452235047156728,"t":"Different institutions accept different IELTS scores for different types of courses. We have","h":0.020593433749724777,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"based our recommendations on the average scores which the majority of institutions accept.","x":0.051497237004382065,"y":0.57518345810918059,"w":0.88257446289062502,"h":0.018696270896208289},{"t":"The institution to which you are applying may, of course, require a higher or lower score than","w":0.8886597696940105,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"x":0.049484548036626087,"y":0.59447674391046834},{"h":0.015871523970796053,"y":0.61212265362047058,"t":"most other institutions.","x":0.047298993093100684,"c":1,"w":0.22094426472981774},{"y":0.64386376965770442,"c":1,"t":"Further information","w":0.23298967997233069,"h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.047422685552329945},{"y":0.66999412816349502,"w":0.86804128011067705,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"t":"For more information about IELTS or any other Cambridge English Language Assessment","x":0.047422658796033565},{"c":1,"y":0.68750205945569731,"x":0.047028751528684604,"t":"examination, write to:","w":0.20903625488281255,"h":0.020313135260214055},{"t":"Cambridge English Language Assessment","h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1,"y":0.72519083991162359,"w":0.4103092702229818,"x":0.047422684373045171},{"c":1,"x":0.047293036798875004,"t":"1 Hills Road","y":0.74219311559834877,"w":0.11778505961100261,"h":0.015613768146938267},{"t":"Cambridge","h":0.016649433254705692,"c":1,"w":0.10741128285725914,"y":0.7612973763757036,"x":0.047325286270517533},{"x":0.047295891373266036,"h":0.013983681141735094,"t":"CB1 2EU","c":1,"y":0.78007211290295975,"w":0.090975227355957033},{"w":0.15596661885579427,"c":1,"t":"United Kingdom","x":0.046739305445379437,"y":0.79561232792372594,"h":0.021358974947344178},{"x":0.047422678592746903,"y":0.83575581411746025,"t":"https:\/\/support.cambridgeenglish.org","w":0.35051546732584637,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"http:\/\/www.ielts.org","h":0.017440418460686891,"y":0.85332163373535586,"x":0.045162232803916777,"w":0.18398454030354822},{"h":0.021137472747426389,"y":0.95436135779267373,"x":0.35225085523804572,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.29135004679361981}]}